#: ../../tools/euhealth_tools.rst:32 ca1defd2a69f43d18243cde438409171
msgid ""
"**Description**: This tool identifies and retrieves relevant links "
"related to publicly accessible datasets and information sources. Using "
"metadata or topic-specific queries, it generates structured outputs of "
"categorized links, including direct download pages, resource portals, and"
" other associated materials. When metadata is unavailable or incomplete, "
"the tool dynamically navigates query results to provide actionable "
"outputs. It also classifies links by type and provides additional "
"contextual details, ensuring users can access pertinent resources for "
"their informational needs."
msgstr ""

